# Conformance probe pack whose own field maps a key the inner pack also maps
# (spec 0.34, Decode step 3 and Encode), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   byte 0      x (the inner conformance-inner-fixed maps x too, in 4 bits)
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-fixed message
format     conformance-inner-shared
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.x  8  uint
inner   conformance-inner-fixed
